Subject: [PATCH] Master: Spotify-style overhaul (icon, theme, home) + offline
 music + downloads and fine-tuning
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Spotify-scale dark theme, app icon = your logo, richer home screen with
  Browse-all grid and carrier shelves, Spotify-style mini-player and
  now-playing screen; playback quality wiring complete.
- Fixes playback (PlaybackController commands), high-quality streaming via
  YouTubeMusic resolveAudio with tier-aware cache.
- Adds MeloNotificationProvider, LyricsWriter, offline music and downloads
  feature, offline playback tests, and fine-tuning across screens/theme.

